                                "sense_id": "c7804163-20f8-3d1d-883e-e2cf19f64b15",
                                "text": "Als beliebtes Motiv, das Emotionen weckt und Leser anzieht, werden Katzenbilder oft als Klickköder verwendet – auch für Nachrichtenartikel, die mit den Tieren wenig oder nichts zu tun haben.",
                                "translation": "As a popular motif that stirs emotions and attracts readers, cat pictures are often used as clickbait – even for news articles that have little or nothing to do with the animals.",
                                "english": "As a popular motif that stirs emotions and attracts readers, cat pictures are often used as clickbait – even for news articles that have little or nothing to do with the animals."
